# SauceDemo — Cypress Automation Testing

An end-to-end (E2E) automation testing project for the SauceDemo e-commerce web application using Cypress and JavaScript.

## Application Under Test

- **Website:** https://www.saucedemo.com/
- **Automation Tool:** Cypress
- **Programming Language:** JavaScript
- **Testing Approach:** End-to-End (E2E) Testing

## Test Scenarios

1. Verify login with valid credentials.
2. Verify login with invalid credentials.
3. Verify login with empty fields.
4. Validate product listings.
5. Add products to the shopping cart.
6. Remove products from the shopping cart.
7. Verify shopping cart details.
8. Complete the checkout process.
9. Validate checkout form fields.
10. Verify successful order completion.

## Project Objectives

- Practice Cypress-based web automation.
- Automate essential e-commerce user workflows.
- Validate application functionality and user interactions.
- Identify and document functional defects.
- Develop practical E2E automation testing skills.

